1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
<i>Announcer:</i> Be sure and remember
what Bert the turtle just did, friends.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Every one of us must remember
to do the same thing.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
That's what this film is all about.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Duck and cover!

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,000
This is an official civil defense film,
produced in cooperation with the Federal Civil Defense Administration

6
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,000
and in consultation with the Safety Commission
of the National Education Association.

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Produced by Archer Productions, Inc.

8
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Hey, Bert, come on out
and meet all these nice people!
